### 1. Login ca ADMIN (Așteptat: 200 OK + JWT Token + ROLE_ADMIN)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@gangstyle.ro",
  "password": "AdminPass123!"
}

### 2. Login ca FRIZER Filip (Așteptat: 200 OK + JWT Token + ROLE_BARBER)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "filip@gangstyle.ro",
  "password": "FilipPass123!"
}

