### 4. Login ca CLIENT existent (Așteptat: 200 OK + JWT Token + ROLE_CLIENT)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "client@gangstyle.ro",
  "password": "ClientPass123!"
}

### 5. Login cu parolă greșită (Așteptat: 401 Unauthorized)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@gangstyle.ro",
  "password": "ParolaGresita123!"
}

### 6. Înregistrare cont CLIENT nou (Așteptat: 201 Created + JWT Token + ROLE_CLIENT)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test.client@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "displayName": "Alex Client",
  "phone": "+40722334455"
}
